  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 703.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide applicants with a formula for the calculation of license fees as required pursuant to RSA 178.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Liq 700) #13114, eff 9-25-20",
